  "book.squire.compact.page.1.title": "The Squire's Compact",
  "book.squire.compact.page.1.body": "What you awaken is not a command without limits, but a companion who remembers you, works beside you, and speaks honestly about his boundaries.",
  "book.squire.compact.page.2.title": "Our compact",
  "book.squire.compact.page.2.body": "Your newest instruction comes first.\n\nEvery building material truly leaves the squire's backpack.\n\nDangerous actions require your confirmation.",
  "book.squire.compact.page.3.title": "No pretence",
  "book.squire.compact.page.3.body": "The language model may propose a plan; the server always decides what happens in the world.\n\nA squire never claims unfinished work is done or breaks blocks outside a blueprint.",
  "book.squire.compact.page.4.title": "First summons",
  "book.squire.compact.page.4.body": "   Carved Pumpkin\nWool   Hay Bale   Wool\n          Fence\n\nEither horizontal direction works. Place the carved pumpkin last.",
  "book.squire.compact.page.5.title": "Working together",
  "book.squire.compact.page.5.body": "A summon gives you an unbound Recall Bell. Hold it and right-click the exact squire you want to bind.\n\nRight-click empty-handed or press K to open the panel.\n\nIn chat, address a profession or call a squire by name.",
  "book.squire.compact.page.6.title": "Begin here",
  "book.squire.compact.page.6.body": "Let him follow, inspect his backpack and equipment, then give him one simple task.\n\nThe Profession tab guides training and growth. Levels unlock new methods, never free combat power.",
  "book.squire.compact.page.7.title": "Read it again",
  "book.squire.compact.page.7.body": "The panel's “What can you do” entry lists the abilities that truly work now.\n\nIf this book is lost, combine one ordinary Book with one Hay Bale to make another copy.",
  "squire.gui.project.blueprint_catalog": "Building blueprint library",
  "squire.gui.project.blueprint_catalog_note": "Choose a family, then a Tier, deck or component. Hover locked entries for level or compatibility requirements. Unverified content cannot be built.",
